# Line-ending policy.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows but everything runs inside Linux containers,
# where CRLF line endings break scripts and configs (e.g. Alpine `sh` cannot run
# a CRLF shell script — that is what broke proxy/gen-cert.sh / `make up-all`).
# Force LF in the working tree for the files Linux tooling consumes, so a fresh
# clone on any OS is correct.

*.sh            text eol=lf
*.j2            text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.cfg           text eol=lf
.env.example    text eol=lf

# Known binary assets — never normalize these.
*.xlsx          binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.safetensors   binary
*.bin           binary
